      "releaseNotes": "Sidefill now works on many more sites. We went through the most visited sites in Korea, Japan and the US and fixed what we found.\n\nFixed: pages that showed an empty column beside Safari's side controls now fill it. This happened on pages with a pop-up, an app banner or a dimmed background.\nFixed: sites that would not widen at all now do.\nFixed: buttons near the side controls no longer land on top of their neighbours. The whole row makes room instead.\nFixed: announcement bars at the top of store pages now reach the edge.\n\nOn the unfolded iPhone Duo used as one large screen, Sidefill now steps aside by itself.",
      "currentVersionReleaseDate": "2026-11-15T01:06:23Z",
      "releaseDate": "2026-11-03T08:00:00Z",
      "trackId": 6830004679,
      "trackName": "Sidefill: Wide View for Safari",
      "genreIds": [
        "6002",
